zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW_gJzwOO-M0_F5sg-1VcABtCjbiLkT4stxNWTK4FrYsg&oe=6B0F0864"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Target Arena VR: Shooting Range", "keywords": ["shootingrangevr", "shootinggame\t", "targetshooting\t", "vrshooting\t", "shootingsimulator\t"], "long_description": "Target Arena VR: Shooting Range delivers an immersive virtual reality target shooting experience designed for players who enjoy precision, accuracy, and skill-based challenges.\n\nStep into a realistic shooting range where you can practice with a variety of firearms, test your reflexes, and improve your aim across multiple target challenges. Whether you're a beginner or an experienced marksman, every session offers a fun and rewarding shooting experience.\n\nFeatures:\n\ud83c\udfaf Realistic VR shooting range\n\ud83d\udd2b Multiple weapons, including pistols and rifles\n\ud83c\udfaf Static and moving target challenges\n\ud83c\udfc6 Score-based gameplay to improve your accuracy\n\u26a1 Smooth and intuitive VR controls\n\ud83c\udf1f Realistic shooting mechanics and sound effects\n\ud83c\udfae Easy to learn, challenging to master\n\ud83d\udc64 Designed for single-player VR gameplay\n\nTrain your precision, compete for higher scores, and become the ultimate marksman in Target Arena VR: Shooting Range!", "short_description": "Master your aim in an immersive VR shooting range. Practice with realistic weapons, hit challenging targets, and improve your shooting skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/javairiabibi/privacy-policy-meta", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zylo Studio VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/javairiabibi/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "co